{"id":"P061-1","subject":"P","unit":"P061","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P061-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n동기조상기의 위상특선곡선에서 전기자 전류가 최소일 때,\n\n역률은 몇 인가?\n\n\n① 1           ② 0.9\n\n③ 0.8          ④ 0.6\n\n⑤ 0.5","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1113}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n60Hz, 4극 3상 유도전동기의 전부하 속도가 1950rpm\n\n이고, 토크가 60kg⦁m일 때, 전동기의 출력은 몇 kW\n\n인가?\n\n\n① 80          ② 100\n\n③ 120         ④ 140\n\n⑤ 160","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m02-e1.webp","width":678,"height":281},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m02-e2.webp","width":696,"height":920}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n2차측 무부하 전압이 500V이고, 정격전압이 480V인\n\n단상 변압기의 전압변동률은 약 몇 인가?\n\n\n① 2         ② 3\n\n③ 4         ④ 5\n\n⑤ 6","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":590},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m03-e1.webp","width":696,"height":964}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n정격용량 2000V이고 정격용량 10000kVA인 동기\n\n발전기의 동기 임피던스가 2Ω일 때, 단락비는?\n\n\n① 0.1          ② 0.12\n\n③ 0.2          ④ 0.25\n\n⑤ 0.3","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m04-e1.webp","width":678,"height":818}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n                                              \n포화하지 않은 직류 발전기에서 회전속도를 기존의  \n\n배로 하고 기전력을 유지하기 위해서는 자속을 몇 배로\n\n하여야 하는가?\n\n\n① 2           ② 3\n\n③ 4           ④ 6\n\n⑤ 9","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":646},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m05-e1.webp","width":678,"height":595}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n효율이 80인 직류발전기의 출력이 20W일 때, 직류\n발전기의 전손실을 몇 W인가?\n\n\n① 1           ② 2\n\n③ 3           ④ 4\n\n⑤ 5","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":587},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m06-e1.webp","width":678,"height":470}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n12극 직류발전기를 중권으로 할 때의 유도기전력을 ,\n\n파권으로 할 때의 유도기전력을 라고 할 때, 기전력의\n비 는? (기타 조건은 동일하다고 가정한다.)    \n\n\n                           \n①            ②  \n\n                           \n③            ④  \n\n    \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":707},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m07-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n4극의 유도전동기에 8극의 유도전동기를 직렬종속으로\n\n접속할 경우에 회전속도는 몇 Hz인가?\n\n(단, 주파수는 60Hz라고 한다.)\n\n\n① 400         ② 600\n\n③ 800         ④ 1200\n\n⑤ 1800","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m08-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1000}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09\n\n직류 분권 전동기의 토크와 전기자 전류의 관계성은?\n\n\n\n① ∝        ② ∝\n\n                                    \n③ ∝        ④ ∝                                              \n\n        \n⑤ ∝\n           ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m09","number":9},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m09-q.webp","width":678,"height":573},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m09-e1.webp","width":678,"height":882}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 10번","searchText":" 10\n\n병렬운전 중인 두 대의 동기 발전기가 있다. 두 발전기의\n\n기전력에 60°의 위상차가 발생한 경우, 수수전력은 몇\n\nW인가? (단, 두 대의 발전기의 유기기전력 크기는\n2000V이고, 동기 리액턴스는 Ω이다.)\n\n\n\n①                ②  ×    \n③ ×        ④ × \n\n⑤ × ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m10","number":10},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m10-q.webp","width":696,"height":705},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m10-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1373}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 11번","searchText":" 11\n\n1차측 정격전압이 5000V이고, 1차측과 2차측의 권선비\n\n가 10:1인 단상변압기가 있다. 2차측 부하에 20A의\n\n전류를 공급하는 경우, 1차측의 입력은 몇 kW인가?\n\n(단, 부하의 역률은 1로 가정한다.)\n\n\n① 4           ② 6\n\n③ 8           ④ 10\n\n⑤ 12","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m11","number":11},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m11-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m11-e1.webp","width":696,"height":509}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 12번","searchText":" 12\n\n2개의 소도체로 구성된 복도체 방식에서 소도체의 반지\n\n름을 m, 소도체간의 간격을 m라 할 때, 복도체의\n\n등가 반지름은 몇 m인가?\n\n①          ② \n③          ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m12","number":12},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m12-q.webp","width":696,"height":535},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m12-e1.webp","width":678,"height":747}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 13번","searchText":" 13\n\n송배전 계통에 발생하는 이상전압의 외부적인 원인에 해당\n\n하는 것은?\n\n\n① 선로의 개폐      ② 고장전류 차단\n\n③ 유도뢰        ④ 지락사고\n\n⑤ 고조파의 공진","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m13","number":13},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m13-q.webp","width":678,"height":443},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m13-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1135}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q14","number":14,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 14번","searchText":" 14\n\n전선의 진동 방지 및 전선 지지점에서의 단선을 방지하는\n\n것은?\n\n\n① 아킹혼        ② 댐퍼\n\n③ 아머로드       ④ 현수 클램프\n\n⑤ 애자","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m14","number":14},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m14-q.webp","width":678,"height":443},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m14-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1375}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q15","number":15,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 15번","searchText":" 15\n\n가공지선의 설치 목적으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n     ㉠ 전압강하의 방지\n\n     ㉡ 통신선에 대한 유도장해의 경감\n\n     ㉢ 직격뢰, 유도뢰로부터 송전선 보호\n\n     ㉣ 철탑의 접지저항 경감\n\n\n① ㉠㉡         ② ㉠㉣\n\n③ ㉡㉢         ④ ㉡㉣\n\n⑤ ㉢㉣","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m15","number":15},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m15-q.webp","width":678,"height":590},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m15-e1.webp","width":696,"height":507}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q16","number":16,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 16번","searchText":" 16\n\n수력발전에서 출력() 유량(), 유효낙차()의 관계로\n\n옳은 것은?\n\n\n① 출력은 유량과 유효낙차에 비례한다.\n\n② 출력은 유량의 제곱과 유효낙차에 비례한다.\n\n③ 출력은 유량과 유효낙차의 제곱에 비례한다.\n\n④ 출력은 유량의 제곱과 유효낙차의 제곱에 비례한다.\n\n⑤ 출력은 유량에 반비례, 유효낙차에 비례한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m16","number":16},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m16-q.webp","width":678,"height":408},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m16-e1.webp","width":678,"height":635}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 17번","searchText":" 17\n\n피뢰기의 구비조건에 해당하는 것은?\n\n    ㉠ 충격방전 개시전압이 낮을 것\n\n    ㉡ 방전내량이 크고 제한전압이 높을 것\n\n    ㉢ 상용주파방전 개시전압이 높을 것\n\n    ㉣ 속류 차단능력이 작을 것\n\n\n\n① ㉠, ㉡        ② ㉠, ㉢\n\n③ ㉠, ㉣        ④ ㉡, ㉢\n\n⑤ ㉢, ㉣","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m17","number":17},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m17-q.webp","width":696,"height":685},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m17-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1247}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 18번","searchText":" 18\n\n부하역률이 30인 경우, 전력용 콘덴서를 병렬로 접속\n\n하여 합성역률을 60로 개선하면 전원측 선로의 전력\n\n손실은 처음의 몇 로 감소되는가?\n\n\n① 70          ② 60\n\n③ 45          ④ 30\n\n⑤ 25","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m18","number":18},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m18-q.webp","width":696,"height":604},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m18-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1163}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q19","number":19,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 19번","searchText":" 19\n\n선간전압의 실횻값이 100V, 선전류의 실횻값이 10A \n\n이고, 각 상의 임피던스가 Ω인 3상 부하의 소비\n\n전력은 몇 W인가?\n\n①           ② \n③         ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m19","number":19},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m19-q.webp","width":696,"height":594},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m19-e1.webp","width":696,"height":719}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q20","number":20,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 20번","searchText":" 20\n\n복도체를 사용하는 경우에 대한 다음 특징의 빈칸에 알맞\n\n은 것은?\n\n 단도체와 비교할 때, 선로의 작용 인덕턴스는 ( ㉠   )\n\n  하고, 작용 정전용량은 ( ㉢ )하고, 선로의 리액턴스는\n\n   ( ㉢  )한다.\n\n\n      ㉠       ㉡       ㉢\n\n ①    감소      감소      감소\n\n ②    감소      증가      감소\n\n ③    감소      증가      증가\n\n ④    증가      증가      감소\n\n ⑤    증가      감소      증가","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m20","number":20},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m20-q.webp","width":678,"height":742},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m20-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1310}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q21","number":21,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 21번","searchText":" 21\n\n3상 3선식에서 대지 정전용량이 0.4Fkm, 선간 정전\n용량이 0.13Fkm라고 할 때, 작용 정전용량은 몇\n\nFkm인가?\n\n\n① 0.53         ② 0.66\n\n③ 0.79         ④ 0.93\n\n⑤ 1.33","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m21","number":21},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m21-q.webp","width":678,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m21-e1.webp","width":678,"height":572}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q22","number":22,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 22번","searchText":" 22\n\n설비용량이 1000kW인 부하의 수용률이 0.6, 부등률이\n\n1.2, 역률이 0.8이라고 할 때, 합성최대수요전력은 몇\n\nkVA 인가?\n\n\n① 500         ② 625\n\n③ 750         ④ 800\n\n⑤ 825","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m22","number":22},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m22-q.webp","width":678,"height":578},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m22-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q23","number":23,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 23번","searchText":" 23\n\n특성 임피던스 와 전파정수 의 관계식으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n    특성 임피던스      전파정수 \n\n         \n ①                                 \n        \n ②                       \n\n         ③                 \n\n         \n ④                 \n\n          ⑤                 ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m23","number":23},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m23-q.webp","width":696,"height":732},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m23-e1.webp","width":678,"height":945}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q24","number":24,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 24번","searchText":" 24\n\n송전계통의 중성점 접지계통에서 소호리액터의 인덕턴스\n\n()와 주파수()의 관계로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n① 소호리액터의 인덕턴스는 주파수에 비례한다.\n\n② 소호리액터의 인덕턴스는 주파수에 반비례한다.\n\n③ 소호리액터의 인덕턴스는 주파수의 제곱에 비례한다.\n\n④ 소호리액터의 인덕턴스는 주파수의 제곱에 반비례한\n\n  다.\n\n⑤ 소호리액터의 인덕턴스는 주파수와 무관하다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m24","number":24},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m24-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m24-e1.webp","width":678,"height":937}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S1-Q25","number":25,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 25번","searchText":" 25\n\nkW의 3상 3선식 송전선로에서, 수전단 전압이\nkV, Ω, Ω, 역률이 0.8일\n\n때, 송전단 전압은 몇 V인가?\n\n\n① 6880         ② 7200\n\n③ 7680         ④ 7880\n\n⑤ 8200","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m25","number":25},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m25-q.webp","width":696,"height":548},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m25-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1279}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]}]}
